# README.md is NOT excluded: it is the best single description of what NubArca
# is, and the external Help knowledge corpus is built from it inside the image.
# It sits after `dotnet publish` in the Dockerfile, so editing documentation
# rebuilds the corpus layer without invalidating restore or compilation.
